pitung puluh guan kanggo saben jaran perang.  Lan

2044
01:01:14,066 --> 01:01:15,466
patang guan saben wedhus.

2045
01:01:15,800 --> 01:01:17,033
Hadiah iki, ditambah sing sadurunge—

2046
01:01:17,066 --> 01:01:18,166
pira regane jaran perang iki?

2047
01:01:19,166 --> 01:01:20,266
Hakim, apa kowé duwé rencana arep?

2048
01:01:21,266 --> 01:01:22,333
Wong-wong ngirimi aku hadiah.  Aku ora isa ora

2049
01:01:22,366 --> 01:01:23,466
mbales budimu.

2050
01:01:24,000 --> 01:01:25,633
Miturut aturan dagang sing wis tak tetepake sadurunge,

2051
01:01:25,800 --> 01:01:26,466
aku bakal ngirim sawetara

2052
01:01:26,500 --> 01:01:27,700
wong Kulon sing tak tangkep bali.

2053
01:01:27,900 --> 01:01:29,000
Sebut wae kuwi mbales budi.

2054
01:01:32,633 --> 01:01:33,333
Hakim.

2055
01:01:33,366 --> 01:01:35,166
Adhedhasar tingkat konversi sing nembe disepakati,

2056
01:01:35,200 --> 01:01:36,333
emas lan wedhus iki bebarengan

2057
01:01:36,366 --> 01:01:37,866
regane kira-kira pitung ewu guan.

2058
01:01:38,000 --> 01:01:39,766
Kanthi pitung puluh senar saben jaran perang,

2059
01:01:40,066 --> 01:01:41,633
tegese udakara satus jaran perang.

2060
01:01:42,033 --> 01:01:43,166
Satus jaran perang!

2061
01:01:43,500 --> 01:01:44,466
Banjur ayo padha loman uga.

2062
01:01:44,666 --> 01:01:46,066
Kirimna bali rong atus wong tuwa lan ringkih.

2063
01:01:48,166 --> 01:01:48,466
Apik tenan.

2064
01:01:49,400 --> 01:01:51,000
Hakim, langkah kuwi pinter—

2065
01:01:51,200 --> 01:01:52,066
pancen pinter.

2066
01:01:52,433 --> 01:01:53,366
Dhuwur utawa ora,

2067
01:01:53,400 --> 01:01:54,766
kita kudu ndeleng sawise dikirim

2068
01:01:54,866 --> 01:01:56,233
apa raine Komandan Yeli

2069
01:01:56,366 --> 01:01:57,733
bakal luwih menarik.

2070
01:01:58,000 --> 01:01:58,966
Amarga Pangeran Jin ing Tapel Wates Kulon gelem,

2071
01:01:59,000 --> 01:02:00,666
aku bakal terus nambah taruhan ing garis iki.

2072
01:02:00,866 --> 01:02:01,566
Mesthi wae, aku seneng

2073
01:02:01,600 --> 01:02:03,300
nggawe game iki luwih menarik.

2074
01:02:04,000 --> 01:02:05,333
Ayo padha nyuwek-nyuwek siji lan sijine.

2075
01:02:11,366 --> 01:02:12,933
Aku duwe kabar apik,

2076
01:02:12,966 --> 01:02:13,600
endi sing pengin kokrungu dhisik?

2077
01:02:13,966 --> 01:02:14,900
Kabar apik dhisik.

2078
01:02:16,400 --> 01:02:16,600
Simpen kabar ala kanggo mengko.  Baginda Raja

2079
01:02:18,533 --> 01:02:19,366
sampun sarujuk.

2080
01:02:19,733 --> 01:02:20,866
Kowé bakal dadi penasihat militer sing ana ing tentara

2081
01:02:20,900 --> 01:02:22,300
lan melu aku metu saka ibukutha kanggo numpes para bandit.

2082
01:02:28,666 --> 01:02:29,900
Kowé ngarani kuwi kabar apik?

2083
01:02:30,500 --> 01:02:32,533
Kanggoku, iki kabar paling apik.

2084
01:02:32,700 --> 01:02:33,500
Kanthi pitulunganmu,

2085
01:02:33,533 --> 01:02:34,833
kredit bakal gampang ditampa.

2086
01:02:35,366 --> 01:02:37,133
Banjur kepiye kuwi apik kanggo aku?

2087
01:02:37,266 --> 01:02:38,533
Aku mung arep ngombe teh ing Istana Klan Kekaisaran.

2088
01:02:38,700 --> 01:02:39,733
Luwih becik tinimbang menehi mangan begal ing pegunungan.

2089
01:02:40,300 --> 01:02:41,233
Nggawe jeneng kanggo awake dhewe.

2090
01:02:41,266 --> 01:02:42,266
Kanggo ngladeni pengadilan, ta?

2091
01:02:42,300 --> 01:02:44,133
Kejaba iku, aku,
adhimu, isih njaga kowe.  Ya wis

2092
01:02:44,200 --> 01:02:45,566
, critakna kabar ala iki marang aku.

2093
01:02:46,700 --> 01:02:48,466
Pangeran Kang nesu banget ing ngarepe Paduka.

2094
01:02:48,500 --> 01:02:49,433
Dhèwèké meksa arep mèlu.

2095
01:02:49,866 --> 01:02:51,900
Sanalika dheweke gawe rame, Baginda sarujuk.

2096
01:02:58,300 --> 01:03:00,033
Bro, dudu merga aku ora pengin ngatonake raimu.  Aku ora isa lunga

2097
01:03:00,066 --> 01:03:01,133
.  Ana apa

2098
01:03:03,000 --> 01:03:03,733
, Cak?  Apa

2099
01:03:03,766 --> 01:03:04,800
kita ora wis duwe kesepakatan?

2100
01:03:05,600 --> 01:03:06,533
Apa maksudmu, "setuju"?

2101
01:03:07,000 --> 01:03:07,833
Nèk dhèwèké kelangan siji rambut waé,

2102
01:03:07,866 --> 01:03:09,066
kita loro kudu nanggung nganggo sirah kita dhéwé.

2103
01:03:09,266 --> 01:03:09,966
Kowé sing njalari iki marang awakmu dhéwé.  Uculna aku! (or)

2104
01:03:10,000 --> 01:03:10,766
Uculna aku!

2105
01:03:12,300 --> 01:03:14,033
Sedulur-sedulur tetep kompak nalika susah!

2106
01:03:14,166 --> 01:03:15,166
Kejaba iku, aku uga nolak dheweke.

2107
01:03:15,200 --> 01:03:16,066
Nanging Baginda Raja maringi prentah.

2108
01:03:16,100 --> 01:03:16,933
Apa maneh sing isa tak lakoni?

2109
01:03:18,300 --> 01:03:20,333
Sedulur, dudu merga aku ora pengin lunga.

2110
01:03:21,366 --> 01:03:22,066
Apa, aku iki edan?

2111
01:03:22,766 --> 01:03:23,533
Kowé wis ora waras.

2112
01:03:23,800 --> 01:03:25,000
Sedina sadurunge wingi, kowe nglawan

2113
01:03:25,033 --> 01:03:26,100
kabeh pengawale Pangeran Kang dhewekan lan menang.  Ana

2114
01:03:26,133 --> 01:03:26,900
apa karo kowe?

2115
01:03:29,666 --> 01:03:30,400
Aku kena wasir.

2116
01:03:34,733 --> 01:03:35,500
Apa?

2117
01:03:36,800 --> 01:03:37,700
Nah...

2118
01:03:37,733 --> 01:03:38,766
aku duwe kondisi ing mburiku.

2119
01:03:39,333 --> 01:03:40,066
Aku ora isa nunggang jaran.

2120
01:03:43,066 --> 01:03:44,733
Oh, maksudmu wasir.

2121
01:03:44,933 --> 01:03:46,866
Ya, kepriye karo wasir?  Lali wae

2122
01:03:50,366 --> 01:03:51,866
, Cak.

2123
01:03:51,900 --> 01:03:52,933
Kowé isih kekecilen.

2124
01:03:52,966 --> 01:03:54,266
Kepriye carane aku bisa kena penyakit kuwi?

2125
01:03:54,500 --> 01:03:55,666
Wasir bisa kedadeyan ing umur apa wae.

2126
01:03:56,833 --> 01:03:57,900
A-aku mung...

2127
01:03:57,933 --> 01:03:58,933
Aku sinau tenanan,

2128
01:03:58,966 --> 01:04:00,566
lungguh kelamaan ngasilaké iki, ya?

2129
01:04:09,633 --> 01:04:10,866
Kowé kena penyakit iki kedhisikan.

2130
01:04:10,966 --> 01:04:12,100
Keputusan kasebut bakal diterbitake sesuk.  Kowé ora isa lolos

2131
01:04:12,133 --> 01:04:13,000
.

2132
01:04:14,000 --> 01:04:15,700
Pangeran Kang wis teka.

2133
01:04:19,733 --> 01:04:21,266
Abdi dalem ingkang andhap asor ngaturaken pakurmatan dhumateng Pangeran Kang.  Rama

2134
01:04:21,333 --> 01:04:22,100
Wang Haochuan

2135
01:04:22,600 --> 01:04:24,633
wis sarujuk nglilani aku lunga
karo kowe kanggo nyerang bandit.

2136
01:04:26,000 --> 01:04:27,500
Paduka, menapa panjenengan mboten kersa tindak?

2137
01:04:27,533 --> 01:04:28,100
Ora.

2138
01:04:28,733 --> 01:04:30,266
Paduka, apa panjenengan mangertos perang

2139
01:04:30,300 --> 01:04:31,033
sejatosipun gumantung dhateng menapa?  Dakkandhani.

2140
01:04:31,866 --> 01:04:33,233
Ora ana sing luwih cepet ngrusak tentara tinimbang komando sing terpecah belah.

2141
01:04:33,266 --> 01:04:33,966
Kowé iku pangeran getih.

2142
01:04:34,000 --> 01:04:35,333
Sawise kowe dadi tentara, yen kowe pengin iki dina iki

2143
01:04:35,366 --> 01:04:36,066
lan ngganti sesuk

2144
01:04:36,100 --> 01:04:36,833
sapa sing wani ngalangi kowe?

2145
01:04:36,866 --> 01:04:37,766
Kepriye carane kita kudu nglawan perang iki?

2146
01:04:38,200 --> 01:04:39,133
Bapak ngendika

2147
01:04:39,166 --> 01:04:41,133
yen kita wis dadi tentara, kita nuruti prentahe Komandan Lu.

2148
01:04:41,266 --> 01:04:43,733
Aja kuwatir, aku uga bakal nuruti prentahmu.

2149
01:04:45,066 --> 01:04:46,566
Lan Paduka Yang Mulia sampun ngendika mekaten piyambak.

2150
01:04:46,933 --> 01:04:47,733
Tembungé wong lanang iku

2151
01:04:48,200 --> 01:04:49,166
ora bisa dibatalake.

2152
01:04:52,333 --> 01:04:52,900
Panitera Wang,

2153
01:04:52,933 --> 01:04:54,300
putri kekaisaran ngundang panjenengan.

2154
01:04:55,333 --> 01:04:56,833
Aku yakin Mbak Putri pengin ngandhani kowe supaya ngurus aku.

2155
01:04:56,866 --> 01:04:57,833
Panitera Wang, luwih becik sampeyan cepet-cepet.

2156
01:04:57,933 --> 01:04:59,066
Aja nganti adhiku ngenteni.

2157
01:05:05,633 --> 01:05:07,400
Pejabat sing andhap asor iki, Wang Haochuan,
panitera Pengadilan Klan Kekaisaran,

2158
01:05:07,566 --> 01:05:09,066
ngaturake pakurmatan marang putri kekaisaran.

2159
01:05:10,700 --> 01:05:12,666
Munggah, Panitera Wang.  Mangga, lenggah.  Matur

2160
01:05:16,066 --> 01:05:16,900
nuwun, Paduka.

2161
01:05:26,166 --> 01:05:27,700
Apa sing kedadeyan antarane Registrar Wang

2162
01:05:27,766 --> 01:05:28,733
lan Putri?

2163
01:05:29,000 --> 01:05:30,033
Kok aneh banget?

2164
01:05:30,833 --> 01:05:32,033
Putri sengaja nimbali dheweke mrene...

2165
01:05:32,166 --> 01:05:34,033
Mung supaya lungguh meneng lan ngombe teh?

2166
01:05:34,433 --> 01:05:35,333
Iku mung siji ukara.

2167
01:05:35,700 --> 01:05:36,900
Yagene angel banget ngomong?

2168
01:05:37,266 --> 01:05:38,000
Apa aku pancen kudu takon...

2169
01:05:38,166 --> 01:05:39,633
apa urusane Paduka kaliyan kula?

2170
01:05:39,666 --> 01:05:41,666
Suasana iki aneh banget.

2171
01:05:42,066 --> 01:05:42,900
Kabeh wis rampung ngombe.

2172
01:05:43,333 --> 01:05:44,166
Yen ora ana sing ngomong,

2173
01:05:44,400 --> 01:05:45,366
apa kita mung arep lungguh ing kene nyekel cangkir kosong

2174
01:05:45,400 --> 01:05:46,200
nganti peteng?

2175
01:05:46,700 --> 01:05:47,666
Nanging topik iki,

2176
01:05:47,900 --> 01:05:48,633
ora preduli kepiye sampeyan ndeleng,

2177
01:05:48,666 --> 01:05:49,766
dudu aku, sing dadi subjek, sing ngungkit dhisik.

2178
01:05:49,900 --> 01:05:52,233
Apa aku kudu takon apa Yang Mulia sehat-
sehat wae akhir-akhir iki?

2179
01:05:52,266 --> 01:05:53,133
Kaku banget.  Kuwi

2180
01:05:53,166 --> 01:05:54,366
sopan banget, wis keterlaluan.  Koyone

2181
01:05:55,466 --> 01:05:56,533
aku sengaja nggoleki bab sing arep dirembug.

2182
01:05:56,733 --> 01:05:58,100
Paduka lan Kepala Panitera Wang iki...

2183
01:05:58,400 --> 01:05:59,466
Apa pancen ana hubungane karo panjenengan kalih?

2184
01:05:59,633 --> 01:06:02,066
Nanging Paduka sampun dados putri kekaisaran ingkang sampun nikah.

2185
01:06:02,100 --> 01:06:02,500
Iki...

2186
01:06:03,300 --> 01:06:04,633
Nalika kowe rumangsa ora kepenak, Putri,

2187
01:06:04,666 --> 01:06:05,633
kowe mesthi nggulung drijimu.

2188
01:06:07,900 --> 01:06:08,633
Paduka

2189
01:06:09,233 --> 01:06:10,700
Ngundang piyambakipun mriki kados mekaten

2190
01:06:10,733 --> 01:06:11,866
nanging boten ngomong apa-apa namung

2191
01:06:12,133 --> 01:06:13,833
badhe ndadosaken piyambakipun langkung bingung.

2192
01:06:15,333 --> 01:06:16,866
Panjenengan badhe numpes para bandit.

2193
01:06:17,033 --> 01:06:17,866
Oh, leres.

2194
01:06:18,033 --> 01:06:18,200
Nyetop—

2195
01:06:18,233 --> 01:06:19,100
Coba nyetop wong-wong mau.

2196
01:06:19,333 --> 01:06:21,966
Aku diprentahake ngetutake Komandan
Lu menyang lor kanggo numpes para bandit.

2197
01:06:22,500 --> 01:06:23,900
Carané ngomong...

2198
01:06:24,033 --> 01:06:25,500
ora kaya topik sing
dirembug karo putri kekaisaran.

2199
01:06:26,033 --> 01:06:28,466
Luwih kaya wong enom biasa sing kaget...

2200
01:06:28,500 --> 01:06:29,866
bingung lan ora bisa ngomong apa-apa.

2201
01:06:30,833 --> 01:06:32,633
Xiao Jiu uga arep lunga karo kowe.

2202
01:06:32,866 --> 01:06:33,900
Dheweke mung seneng dolanan wae.

2203
01:06:34,266 --> 01:06:34,866
Kowé...

2204
01:06:37,566 --> 01:06:39,300
Kowé ngrawat dhèwèké kanthi becik.

2205
01:06:39,733 --> 01:06:41,266
Ya, aku bakal njaga dheweke kanthi becik.  Mugi-mugi panjenengan kersa marem

2206
01:06:46,733 --> 01:06:47,533
, Paduka.

2207
01:06:47,700 --> 01:06:48,833
Aku ora bakal ngorbanake awake dhewe

2208
01:06:48,866 --> 01:06:50,100
kanggo njaga Pangeran Kang supaya tetep aman lan sehat.

2209
01:06:50,133 --> 01:06:51,233
Mangga tentremaken manah panjenengan, putri kekaisaran.

2210
01:06:56,400 --> 01:06:57,133
Kowé...

2211
01:06:58,400 --> 01:07:00,800
Apa kowé butuh apa-apa kanggo kampanye iki?

2212
01:07:01,200 --> 01:07:02,133
Yen kowe butuh apa-apa,

2213
01:07:02,166 --> 01:07:03,366
kowe isa ngomong karo aku,

2214
01:07:04,266 --> 01:07:06,766
utawa kowe isa takon langsung karo Xiao Jiu.

2215
01:07:07,266 --> 01:07:08,233
Matur nuwun kanggo keprihatinan panjenengan, Paduka.

2216
01:07:08,433 --> 01:07:09,433
Aku wis siyap kanthi lengkap.

2217
01:07:09,566 --> 01:07:10,200
Kabeh sing kokbutuhake

2218
01:07:10,233 --> 01:07:11,500
wis diatur dening Komandan Lu.

2219
01:07:11,666 --> 01:07:13,100
Aku ora wani ngganggu Paduka
lan Pangeran Kang maneh.

2220
01:07:14,366 --> 01:07:15,733
Banjur kowé isa lunga.  Kuwi wae

2221
01:07:22,433 --> 01:07:24,166
?

2222
01:07:24,666 --> 01:07:26,033
Paduka Ratu ngundang piyambakipun mriki

2223
01:07:26,066 --> 01:07:27,300
namung kanggé nanya kalih pitakenan punika?

2224
01:07:27,333 --> 01:07:28,966
Banjur kita mung lungguh ing kono lan mandeng
siji lan sijine kanthi kikuk nalika ngombe teh.

2225
01:07:29,466 --> 01:07:31,233
Apa mung kuwi sing pengin panjenengan takoni, Paduka?

2226
01:07:35,533 --> 01:07:37,166
Aku wis tau ketemu kaping pirang-pirang,
nanging aku durung nate gugup kaya ngene.

2227
01:07:37,833 --> 01:07:39,566
Nglampahi wektu dhewekan ing kraton putri kekaisaran.

2228
01:07:39,833 --> 01:07:40,533
Tekanan kaya ngono kuwi

2229
01:07:40,566 --> 01:07:42,400
meh padha karo nyerang kavaleri Kulon.

2230
01:07:44,100 --> 01:07:45,233
Apa sing diomongake Mbakyuku marang kowe?

2231
01:07:45,533 --> 01:07:46,766
Ancaman cilik iki maneh.  Ayo rampungake wae iki

2232
01:07:46,933 --> 01:07:48,300
.

2233
01:07:48,600 --> 01:07:49,766
Putri kekaisaran mung menehi pitunjuk

2234
01:07:49,800 --> 01:07:50,933
supaya aku luwih ati-ati ing dalan.

2235
01:07:52,933 --> 01:07:54,100
Hei, aja lunga!

2236
01:07:54,166 --> 01:07:55,066
Kenging punapa panjenengan mboten ngancani kula

2237
01:07:55,100 --> 01:07:56,100
lenggah kaliyan Mbakyu Putri sakwetara,

2238
01:07:58,533 --> 01:07:59,200
Paduka?

2239
01:07:59,233 --> 01:08:00,366
Kepriye menawi Paduka ngandhani kula rumiyin,

2240
01:08:00,500 --> 01:08:01,900
wonten pundi kakus ing plataran putri?

2241
01:08:01,933 --> 01:08:03,366
Aku pancen ora kuat nahan maneh! (Aku sungguh tidak kuat menahannya lagi!)

2242
01:08:04,366 --> 01:08:04,900
Kowé...

2243
01:08:04,933 --> 01:08:06,133
Kowé pancen kudu nguyuh?

2244
01:08:06,733 --> 01:08:07,800
Sapa ngerti teh kratonmu kuwi bisa dadi

2245
01:08:07,833 --> 01:08:08,533
diuretik?

2246
01:08:09,600 --> 01:08:11,200
Cepet, gawanen Panitera Wang menyang jamban.

2247
01:08:17,300 --> 01:08:19,300
Xiao Jiu, apa sing ndadekake kowe seneng banget?  Mbak

2248
01:08:19,433 --> 01:08:20,766
, kowe ora ngerti blas.  Saiki wae

2249
01:08:20,800 --> 01:08:21,933
, Wang Haochuan,

2250
01:08:22,833 --> 01:08:23,600
dheweke pancen pengin nguyuh.

2251
01:08:23,733 --> 01:08:25,466
Apa dhèwèké ngombé tèh kakèhan ing omahmu

2252
01:08:26,233 --> 01:08:26,966
lan ora bisa nahan dhiri?

2253
01:08:27,000 --> 01:08:28,533
Nalika dheweke metu, dheweke takon ngendi jambane.

2254
01:08:40,000 --> 01:08:40,700
Paduka Yang Mulia.

2255
01:08:40,866 --> 01:08:42,400
Para bandit wis nyerang Pegunungan Taihang,

2256
01:08:42,633 --> 01:08:43,566
nyerang kutha-kutha lan kabupaten,

2257
01:08:43,833 --> 01:08:44,800
kampanye bola-bali gagal nenangake.

2258
01:08:44,966 --> 01:08:45,900
Rakyat-rakyat padha ora tenang.

2259
01:08:46,466 --> 01:08:47,533
Kanthi iki aku nunjuk Lu Huai'an

2260
01:08:47,633 --> 01:08:49,366
minangka Komisaris kanggo
Penindasan Bandit ing Pegunungan Taihang.

2261
